# Copied to .dev.vars by `pnpm dev`. The Worker's secrets for local runs; never commit .dev.vars.
BETTER_AUTH_SECRET=local-development-only-secret-0123456789abcdef
# Optional: lets the review app read feedback (GET /v1/admin/feedback); at least 32 characters, the same value as the
# review app's FEEDBACK_READ_TOKEN. Without it the route does not exist.
# FEEDBACK_READ_TOKEN=local-development-only-feedback-token-0123456789
# Optional: lets the review app look an account up, delete one and read the sweep's counts (/v1/admin/accounts/*); at
# least 32 characters, the same value as the review app's ADMIN_WRITE_TOKEN, and not the token above. Without it the
# routes do not exist.
# ADMIN_WRITE_TOKEN=local-development-only-admin-write-token-0123456789
# Optional: the passkeys' relying party id (default: the hostname of BASE_URL, localhost here). Production sets wordado.com in wrangler.jsonc.
# PASSKEY_RP_ID=localhost
# Optional: reminders. `pnpm --filter @wordado/server vapid-keys` prints a pair.
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:you@example.com
